# FlowBite environment variables (TEMPLATE - this file is tracked by git).
# Copy it to `.env` and put your real key there. NEVER paste a real key here.
#
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY powers the "Smart Craving" menu-suggestion feature.
# Get a key from https://aistudio.google.com/apikey
#
# Heads up: anything prefixed with VITE_ is inlined into the browser bundle by
# Vite, so this key is readable by anyone who opens the deployed site. That is
# an accepted trade-off for this local/demo build. Before deploying publicly,
# restrict the key in Google AI Studio or move the call behind a server.
#
# Without a key the app still runs - Smart Craving simply hides itself.
VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Optional. Overrides the model pinned in src/data/cravingClient.js.
# Leave blank unless the default starts returning 404 "no longer available".
VITE_GEMINI_MODEL=
